      "description": "Watch Santos vs Athletico Paranaense highlights and goals from Brasileirão on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 9, 2026. Santos and Athletico Paranaense faced off in a high-stakes Serie A clash, with both sides desperate to assert their dominance in the Brazilian top flight. The atmosphere was electric as the fans prepared for a tactical battle under the lights. Viveros Takes Center Stage On August 9, 2026 , the Serie A action heated up early as Athletico Paranaense looked sharp from the opening whistle. Kevin Viveros became the man of the hour, opening the scoring in the 14th minute. His clinical finish silenced the home crowd and set the tone for the visitors. The pressure continued, and in the 26th minute, Joao Cruz provided a brilliant assist for Kevin Viveros , who found the back of the net for the second time to secure a quick-fire brace. The match saw its fair share of physical tension as well. Adonis Frias received a yellow card at the 20-minute mark for a mistimed challenge. Despite his goal-scoring heroics, Kevin Viveros was also cautioned by the referee in the 34th minute, highlighting the aggressive nature of the contest in the first half. Tactical Shifts and Final Whistle The second half saw a flurry of tactical changes as both managers looked to influence the outcome. Benjamin Rollheiser replaced Gustavo Caballero at the break, and later, players like Thaciano , Willian Arao , and Dudu entered the fray to provide fresh energy. Santos attempted to fight back by introducing Kerwin Vargas and Felipinho , but the disciplined defensive line of Athletico Paranaense held firm. As the clock ticked toward the 90-minute mark, the intensity remained high, but the clear-cut chances became scarce. After seven minutes of stoppage time, the referee blew the final whistle at 90+7', confirming a solid performance from Athletico Paranaense and a night to remember for Kevin Viveros ."
